[["أَلْهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you","Al haaku mut takathur"],["حَتَّىٰ زُرْتُمُ ٱلْمَقَابِرَ","Until you visit the graveyards.","Hatta zurtumul-maqaabir"],["كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","No! You are going to know.","Kalla sawfa ta'lamoon"],["ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُونَ","Then no! You are going to know.","Thumma kalla sawfa ta'lamoon"],["كَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عِلْمَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty...","Kalla law ta'lamoona 'ilmal yaqeen"],["لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ","You will surely see the Hellfire.","Latara-wun nal jaheem"],["ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ ٱلْيَقِينِ","Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.","Thumma latara wunnaha 'ainal yaqeen"],["ثُمَّ لَتُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","Thumma latus alunna yauma-izin 'anin na'eem"]]